  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, equation of plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>,</p><p>Point is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And the direction ratio of plane parallel to the given plane is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, Equation of plane when D.R of parallel plane is given is,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Distance between points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#38;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>&#160;unit</mtext></math></p>",
